NNAAMMEE
     mmkkeessddbb — generates conversion catalog for iconv(3)

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     mmkkeessddbb [--mmdd] --oo _o_u_t_f_i_l_e _i_n_f_i_l_e

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The mmkkeessddbb utility generates conversion catalog for the iconv(3) library.
     The generated data includes a list of supported encodings and their most
     important characteristics, like the pluggable module to use

     The following options are available:

     --dd    Turns on debug mode.

     --mm    Process directory catalog or alias file.  If not specified, the in‐
           put file is treated as an encoding description.

     --oo _o_u_t_f_i_l_e
           Put generated binary data to _o_u_t_f_i_l_e.

EEXXIITT SSTTAATTUUSS
     The mmkkeessddbb utility exits 0 on success, and >0 if an error occurs.

SSEEEE AALLSSOO
     iconv(1), mkcsmapper(1), iconv(3)

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     mmkkeessddbb first appeared in NetBSD 2.0, and made its appearance in
     FreeBSD 9.0.

